GoldenrodCity_Interior21_Text_LittleGirl::
	.string "When I use an item on my POKéMON, it\n"
	.string "acts really glad!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior21_Text_BaldingMan::
	.string "I keep losing in battles, and my\n"
	.string "POKéMON end up fainting...\p"
	.string "Maybe that’s why my POKéMON don’t\n"
	.string "like me much...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior21_Text_Woman3_1::
	.string "If you treat your POKéMON nicely,\n"
	.string "they will love you in return.\p"
	.string "Oh? Let me see your first POKéMON...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior21_Text_Woman3_2::
	.string "I just can’t believe how much it\n"
	.string "hates you!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior21_Text_Woman3_3::
	.string "It doesn’t seem to like you at all.\n"
	.string "It looks mean.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior21_Text_Woman3_4::
	.string "You should treat it better. It’s\n"
	.string "not used to you.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior21_Text_Woman3_5::
	.string "It’s quite cute.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior21_Text_Woman3_6::
	.string "It’s friendly toward you. It looks\n"
	.string "sort of happy.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior21_Text_Woman3_7::
	.string "I get the feeling that it really\n"
	.string "trusts you.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior21_Text_Woman3_8::
	.string "It looks really happy! It must\n"
	.string "love you a lot.$"
